kubectl get rolebindings -A

-A means:

--all-namespaces

Now:

kubectl get clusterrolebindings

Then:

kubectl get roles -A

And:

kubectl get clusterroles

You're essentially building this picture:

        IDENTITIES
             ↓
        BINDINGS
             ↓
          ROLES
             ↓
